# GreenPilot AI — optional live grid-intensity feed.
#
# The engine runs fully offline by default with no key. Set this ONLY if you
# want `--grid-source live` to pull real carbon-intensity data from
# Electricity Maps. Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and fill in
# your key, or export the variable in your shell.
#
# Get a key from Electricity Maps: https://www.electricitymaps.com/
# NOTE: this is NOT an OpenAI key — Electricity Maps is a separate service
# with its own API key.

ELECTRICITYMAPS_API_KEY=your_electricity_maps_key_here
